# Session Summary

After completing each user request, append a short entry to `.cursor/session-summary.md`.

Include:
- what the user asked for
- what was answered, changed, or decided
- important files, commands, or follow-up actions

Keep entries brief, factual, and append-only so the file can serve as a lightweight conversation memory when context is trimmed.
